{%- comment -%}
BLACK WEEK 2026 · boards 04–07 · product grid of a collection as Black Week product cards (white, title + price +
swatches), 4 per row on desktop and 2 on mobile, 16 px gap, 48 per page with a simple pager. Only products that are
available for sale are shown. Cards have quick add (bw-product-card quick_add). Filters and sorting from the URL apply (Shopify does that for collection.products).
Params: coll (collection, default the current one) · badge (override for every card) · offer_only (true = the
"Black Week" badge only on products that are in a Black Week offer, for ordinary collections)
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign bw_coll = coll | default: collection -%}
{%- if bw_coll != blank -%}
  {%- paginate bw_coll.products by 48 -%}
    <div class="bw-grid bw-grid-4">
      {%- for p in bw_coll.products -%}
        {%- if p.available == false -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
        {%- render 'bw-product-card', product: p, badge: badge, offer_only: offer_only, quick_add: true -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div>
    {%- if paginate.pages > 1 -%}
      <nav class="bw-pager" aria-label="Sider">
        {%- if paginate.previous -%}<a href="{{ paginate.previous.url }}">Forrige</a>{%- endif -%}
        <span>Side {{ paginate.current_page }} af {{ paginate.pages }}</span>
        {%- if paginate.next -%}<a href="{{ paginate.next.url }}">Næste</a>{%- endif -%}
      </nav>
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endpaginate -%}
{%- endif -%}
